Tenure: {months} months
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Monthly EMI: ${emi:.2f}
Total Payment: ${total_payment:.2f}
Total Interest: ${total_interest:.2f}
"""
    messagebox.showinfo("EMI Calculator", result)

